3:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"The 4 CTA Failure Modes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"When a CTA underperforms, it's almost always one of four things. Identify which failure mode you're dealing with before making any changes."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"1. Wrong timing."}]," The CTA appears before the page has delivered proof. Visitors land, see a 'Book a call' button in the first screen, and leave - not because they don't want your offer, but because they haven't been given a reason to say yes yet. Proof must precede the ask."]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"2. Wrong copy."}]," 'Submit', 'Click here', 'Start' - these words communicate nothing about what happens next. They create friction because the visitor has to guess the outcome. Outcome-specific copy like 'Get my free leak report' removes the guesswork and converts significantly better."]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"3. Wrong commitment level."}]," Asking a cold visitor to book a 45-minute demo call is a high-commitment ask. They don't know you. A free report, a quick audit, a 15-minute call - these are easier first steps that match the trust level of a first visit."]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"4. Wrong visual contrast."}]," A button that disappears into the page - same colour as surrounding elements, too small on mobile, no visual weight - won't get clicked even by motivated visitors. The primary CTA needs to be the most visually prominent interactive element on the page."]}]]}]]}]
4:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"The Commitment Ladder: Match Your Ask to Traffic Temperature"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Not all visitors are equal. Someone clicking a retargeting ad who's visited your site three times is in a very different state than someone who found you from a cold Meta ad. Your CTA should reflect where that visitor sits on the commitment ladder - not where you'd like them to be."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Cold traffic"}]," (first visit, paid social, cold outreach): The appropriate ask is low-friction and value-first. Name + email in exchange for a specific deliverable - a report, an audit, a score, a checklist. The visitor needs a reason to hand over anything, so the offer has to be concrete and the effort minimal."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Warm traffic"}]," (retargeting, email list, returning visitor): They've seen your brand before. A 15-minute discovery call or a low-price entry product is now appropriate. They have baseline trust. You can ask for more time or a small financial commitment."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Hot traffic"}]," (referral, high-intent search, existing lead): These visitors are comparison-shopping or ready to buy. A 'Buy now' or 'Start today' CTA with clear pricing and risk reversal (money-back guarantee, free trial) is appropriate. Don't make them fill in another lead form - get out of their way."]}]]}]
5:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"CTA Copy Formula: Action + Outcome + Risk Reducer"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["The single highest-leverage CTA improvement is almost always the copy. Generic verbs ('Submit', 'Go', 'Start') say nothing about what happens next. The formula that consistently outperforms is: ",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"[Action verb] + [specific outcome] + [risk reducer]"}],"."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The action verb tells the visitor what to do. The specific outcome tells them what they get. The risk reducer removes the hesitation. Combined, the CTA becomes a micro-promise rather than a command."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"'Submit'"}]," → ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-semibold","children":"'Get my free leak report'"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"'Start'"}]," → ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-semibold","children":"'See my conversion score - free'"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"'Buy now'"}]," → ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-semibold","children":"'Fix my page in 7 days - $97'"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"'Book a call'"}]," → ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-accent font-semibold","children":"'Book a 15-min audit call - no pitch'"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Notice that the better versions are specific. They name the deliverable, the timeframe, or the price. Specificity reduces friction because it removes guesswork about what happens after the click."}]]}]
6:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"The One CTA Rule"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Every competing link, secondary CTA, or navigation item on a landing page pulls attention away from your primary action. Research on attention and decision-making is consistent: more choices reduce the probability of any choice being made. On a landing page, this effect is compounding."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"A rough working rule: each additional clickable element on a conversion-focused page dilutes the primary CTA by approximately 10%. A page with a primary CTA, a secondary CTA, a 'Learn more' link, a navigation bar, and a footer menu has significantly fragmented the visitor's attention before they've even decided whether they want what you're offering."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Strip the page to one action. Remove navigation. Remove secondary buttons. Remove 'learn more' links. If you need to keep a secondary option for warm visitors (like 'See how it works'), make it visually subordinate - a text link or ghost button, never the same weight as the primary CTA. One page, one goal."}]]}]
7:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Quick Wins Checklist"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"If you need to prioritise, start with the items that have the highest priority with the lowest implementation effort."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-accent font-bold","children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Visual contrast."}]," Your primary CTA button must stand out against the page background. If you have to look for it, visitors won't find it."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-accent font-bold","children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Outcome copy."}]," Replace generic verbs with specific deliverables. What does the visitor get when they click?"]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-accent font-bold","children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Proof above the CTA."}]," At least one testimonial, result, or trust signal should appear before the primary CTA. Don't ask before you've demonstrated."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-accent font-bold","children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Single CTA per page."}]," Remove competing links and secondary actions. One page, one goal."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-accent font-bold","children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Mobile tap target."}]," The button must be at minimum 44×44px on mobile - Apple's HIG standard. Small buttons hurt mobile conversion rates."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 text-accent font-bold","children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Risk reducer in copy or beneath button."}]," A line like 'No credit card required' or 'Free - takes 2 minutes' immediately below the button reduces hesitation at the moment of decision."]}]]}]]}]]}]
